        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-1622, 3\" Tapered Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tapered Cabinet Door Handle is simple yet beautiful. Its style is very current--with a finger on the pulse of contemporary design trends. Made by RK International, this plain tapered pull is available in 6 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/tapered-appliance-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-4804\"><b>12 Inch Tapered Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-1622 Traditional Tapered Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
